				"description": "Self-hosted, declarative email server you run on your own VPS. Standard IMAP/SMTP mailboxes, your domain, DKIM/SPF/DMARC, a Go REST API and React admin UI. Privacy through infrastructure ownership rather than a hosted encrypted service.",
				"url": "https://vectismail.com/",
