					<tr><th scope="row">Mailboxes</th><td>25/domain (Starter) · unlimited (Pro)</td><td>1 (Free) · up to 10–15 addresses (paid)</td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">REST sending API + webhooks</th><td><strong>Yes</strong></td><td>No</td></tr>
